flowchart TB
accTitle: Test deployed infrastructure before promotion
accDescr: A private GitHub source starts a pipeline that provisions an isolated CloudFormation stack, runs CodeBuild integration tests, gates promotion and cleans up on success or failure.
G["Private GitHub commit<br/>Authorized connection"]:::inputData --> C["CloudFormation actions<br/>Create and execute test change set"]:::process
C --> T["CodeBuild integration tests<br/>Against isolated resources"]:::process
T --> P{"Tests pass?"}:::decision
P -->|Yes| R["Candidate eligible<br/>for production promotion"]:::output
P -->|No| B["Block promotion<br/>Retain diagnostic report"]:::error
C -.->|Provisioning failure| X["Failure cleanup"]:::warning
B --> X
R --> Y["Success cleanup"]:::process
